---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { business } from '../config/business';
---
<Layout title={`Call Kevin | ${business.name}`} description="Call Kevin at Mutual Builders Corporation to discuss your roof in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania. Over 70 years in business."><section class="page-intro wrap"><div class="eyebrow">CONTACT KEVIN</div><h1>Your roof.<br/>Let’s talk.</h1></section><article class="wrap content"><p>{business.name} serves Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania only.</p>{business.phone ? <a class="button" href={`tel:${business.phone}`}>Call Kevin · {business.phoneDisplay || business.phone}</a> : <p class="notice">Kevin’s phone number: awaiting verification.</p>}<p>When calling, have your property location and a brief description of your roofing question ready. Ask about available services and next steps.</p><p>Business address and hours: awaiting confirmation.</p></article></Layout>
